  "pinned": false,
  "is_template": false,
  "description": "# Conversation Summary\n\n1. **Issue Identified**: Workspace selection in `WorkspacesSection.vue` wasn't opening apps properly because it used the navigation API instead of the store.\n\n2. **Root Cause**: The `handleSelectWorkspaceApp` method called `this.navigation.workspaces.open()` which didn't trigger the proper app opening mechanism.\n\n3. **Solution Implemented**: Replaced the navigation call with `this.$storex.ui.showApp()` to open workspaces as proper apps with unique identifiers and parameters.\n\n4. **Parameters Added**: The fix includes creating a unique `tabId`, passing workspace `name`, specifying `component: 'workspace'`, and providing workspace metadata in `params`.\n\n5. **Behavior Preserved**: The solution maintains the existing close emit for sidebar behavior while ensuring workspaces open correctly through the store's app management system.",
